1
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:12,960
Brighten up the world and
then step back and take a look.

2
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:28,780
about the rainy day after the rain stopped,
when it felt like someone was calling out to you.

3
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,660
I walked on while looking back.

4
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:35,320
Led by the hand by Gā-chan,

5
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:42,300
the strange feeling I had back then

6
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:47,720
So on the tiles of the arcade street,

7
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:53,520
I tried walking only on the black ones.

8
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,680
Everyone was a child once,

9
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:01,820
but everyone has forgotten.

10
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:09,120
Even the politicians with their self-important
faces and the blue-eyeshadow aunties above them,

11
00:01:09,630 --> 00:01:14,700
Try turning at that corner.

12
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:19,900
You'll get to meet everyone, everyone.

13
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:27,840
Over there is Kame-ari,
well, surely there's Kame-ari.

14
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:33,100
Everyone, come on over to our town!

15
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,600
Thank you.

16
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:38,980
Wait, big break!

17
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:02,580
Oh no! I'm late!

18
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:06,880
That bus! Matt!

19
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:10,500
Ahahaha! What's with that hair!

20
00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:13,660
But I was about to be late.

21
00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:17,200
Even if you're about to be late,
you still have to look presentable.

22
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:20,276
That's just like the monster from
those horror movies I saw long ago,

23
00:02:20,326 --> 00:02:22,000
the one with hair made of snakes.

24
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:25,560
That's exactly why no
one will ever marry you.

25
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:29,360
What's it to you?
I don't need you telling me that.

26
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,840
Yeah, that's going too far.

27
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,200
Yeah, exactly!

28
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:36,340
Before you start screaming, look at this!

29
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,860
Hey, Nakagawa-san.

30
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:43,820
You and Reiko-san really do look good together,
after all.

31
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:48,040
Look at this, Komachi! Compared to Nakagawa
and Reiko with their fresh, clean image,

32
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,680
you're so pathetic right now.

33
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:52,320
Now that you mention it, maybe so.

34
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:52,900
That's not fair!

35
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,260
That's just not fair!

36
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:57,800
You're completely dragging down the
image of the Katsushika police force.

37
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:03,580
Just you wait, Kankichi!

38
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:05,700
I can be serious too when I need to!

