63
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:45,860
Hey, you can get one anytime, you know.
It's a makeover, a makeover!

64
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:50,360
From today on,
I'm going visual-kei, you know. Haa.

65
00:03:53,720 --> 00:04:00,960
I feel like I've been reborn. I didn't know
collecting everyone's attention could feel this good.

66
00:04:01,540 --> 00:04:07,640
Excuse me, do you have a moment?
I'm a photographer for Weekly Young Boy.

67
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,880
Photographer?

68
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:11,676
Yes,

69
00:04:11,726 --> 00:04:16,240
we're actually doing a feature called
"Cute Girls We Found Around Town."

70
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:19,180
We'd really love to take
just one photo of you.

71
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:23,020
Fine, just one.

72
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:23,640
Thank you.

73
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,080
What? Best One?

74
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,220
Cute girls found around town.

75
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:34,160
Number one in the ...
category, amazing, Komachi-chan.

76
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:36,180
What on earth is going on?

77
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:39,820
Even a mountain monkey like her being picked as Best One,
the world really is ending.

78
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,040
What do you mean, mountain monkey?

79
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:44,840
It means people out there actually look,
they really see.

80
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,000
Chief.

81
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,640
Komachi-kun.

82
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:51,140
You've contributed greatly to
improving Katsushika's image.

83
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,000
Please continue to look after us.

84
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,860
We're proud too,
as products of the same kind, but

85
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:57,540
Right.

86
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:59,480
W-what?

87
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,380
There he is!

88
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:00,960
She's here!

89
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:01,680
We found her!

90
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,500
It's Komachi.

91
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:03,400
Damn it.

92
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:04,660
Aaaaah

93
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,640
Aaaaah

94
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,440
Aaaaah

95
00:05:18,780 --> 00:05:20,320
This is incredible!

96
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,880
So everyone's here to cover Komachi-san?

97
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:25,320
What, that's ridiculous!

98
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:29,940
These days, approachable idols are more
popular than stars who are out of reach.

99
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:31,540
O-oh, this is a problem.

100
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:32,760
Please look this way.

101
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:33,480
Yes.

102
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:34,760
No good.

103
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,760
Please, that's enough for now.

104
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,520
Could I get one over here too, please?

105
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,560
Hey, this one's already you!

106
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,280
Yes.

107
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:44,600
Even while reluctant, she's still
accommodating every request properly.

108
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:47,420
That wild monkey, an idol?

109
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,700
Wait a minute.

110
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:52,260
We can't let this popularity go to waste.

111
00:06:00,700 --> 00:06:05,820
So you're Mr. Ryotsu,
the exclusive manager of that Ono Komachi?

112
00:06:06,340 --> 00:06:09,840
That's right. Please go through
me for anything regarding Komachi.

113
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:11,220
I see.

114
00:06:11,220 --> 00:06:15,380
Well, we've been keeping a close eye
on Komachi-san's popularity as well.

115
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,900
Sugiyama, bring some coffee.

116
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,460
Yes.

117
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:20,560
No, coffee's fine.

118
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:26,460
Besides, the neon lights have just come on.

119
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,340
The neon, you know.

120
00:06:30,340 --> 00:06:31,420
Neon.

121
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:32,380
Neon.

122
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:36,020
Yes, I understand.

123
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:38,740
Hey.

124
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,880
Well, it's fun, I suppose.

125
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:46,320
So, Ryo-san, with that said, I think
you'll be satisfied with the payment.

126
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:48,620
Hey, it's not a payment,
it's a thank-you gift.

127
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:51,620
It's purely a token of
your sincere feelings.

128
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:54,360
Yeah, yeah, we get it.

129
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:02,980
I'm going to be in a commercial?

130
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:06,084
Sh, keep your voice down!
It's still only a tentative offer.

131
00:07:06,134 --> 00:07:08,140
Don't tell anyone.

132
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:10,800
Anyway, now that I've become your manager,

133
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:13,660
I'll push you hard, so leave it to me.

134
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,960
Why are you the manager?

135
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,780
What do you mean "why," for crying out loud?

136
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:22,660
No, it's an order from the chief to
boost the image of the Katsushika station.

137
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:24,380
An order from the chief?

138
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:27,772
That's right.
Well, I'm a busy man with a lot on my plate,

139
00:07:27,822 --> 00:07:29,720
but I can't go against the chief's orders.

140
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:32,860
Kankichi Ryotsu has decided to lend a hand.

141
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:35,700
If it's an order from the chief,
I suppose it can't be helped.

142
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:46,060
Alright, let's try it for real.

143
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,260
I'll arrest Akudama Key!

144
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:51,960
The Gokkun Drink that Komachi drinks too.

145
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:58,520
Here it comes! So that's the Komachi-ppe?

146
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,280
She's like a totally different person!

147
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:02,340
Still, it's a happy occasion, isn't it?

148
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:05,440
I'll arrest Akudama Key!

149
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:08,140
The Gokkun Drink that Komachi drinks too.

150
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:10,860
Hey, show it again!

151
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,520
That's all it is, this.

152
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,540
That's right, that's right.

153
00:08:16,780 --> 00:08:18,700
How many times do you need to watch it?

154
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,560
Akutama-kin, you're under arrest!

155
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:26,360
Yeah, that's right, Hawaiyaa.

156
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:29,360
Wow, you really do have a daughter

157
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:29,982
Wow,

158
00:08:30,032 --> 00:08:33,560
Compared to our daughter,
she's like a turtle next to the moon.

159
00:08:33,560 --> 00:08:36,460
Yes, this is Ono. Is this Komachi?

160
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:38,880
Hey, did you air my
commercial over there too?

161
00:08:39,140 --> 00:08:41,960
We did. I've recorded it
and watched it over and over.

162
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:44,420
Hey, Katsushika. Is it Komachi?

163
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:48,940
Our relatives and everyone in
the village are all watching it.

164
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:51,300
We're celebrating through the night tonight!

165
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,100
I'm embarrassed.

166
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:01,160
Ryo-san, please think about Komachi's photo book,
I'd appreciate it.

167
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,600
Well, I'll think about it.

168
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:10,680
Sure thing, Komachi-chan.

169
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,440
Yes, yes, that's it. Good, good.

170
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:30,580
Please make Komachi-san
our company's campaign girl.

171
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:33,080
Leave it to me.

172
00:09:35,140 --> 00:09:37,020
Come on, hurry up, hurry up.

173
00:09:37,620 --> 00:09:39,800
Why is everything so busy all the time?

174
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:42,140
At least let me eat breakfast in peace.

175
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:45,080
If it's food you want, I'll make
sure you eat until you're sick of it.

176
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,780
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

177
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:55,060
Even Komachi eats Katsushika rice.

178
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,040
Thank you very much.

179
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,300
It's sweet potato.

180
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:04,480
Sweet potato?

181
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:07,260
It's strangely heavy, isn't it?

182
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:09,680
Whoa!

183
00:10:10,060 --> 00:10:13,740
T-this looks delicious... sweet potatoes.

184
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:23,380
Mm, Echigoya, you're quite the rogue yourself.
Compared to you, my lord, I'm nothing at all.

185
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,840
What are you talking about?

186
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,680
Me?

187
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:31,520
Me?

188
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,760
If you don't get up, I'll arrest you!

189
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:47,920
This is a problem.

190
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,900
You really did come along, didn't you?

191
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:06,140
At this rate, I can't get any work done.

192
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:07,420
It can't be helped, I suppose.

193
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:10,060
It's all for the sake of improving Katsushika Police Station's image,
after all.

194
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:15,280
My work for today is now over.

195
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,760
Please, go home now.

196
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,760
Thank you for your hard work, Komachi-san.

197
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:22,260
Thanks.

198
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:24,260
Yes, thank you.

199
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:27,080
I'm exhausted.

200
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,400
Thanks for your hard work.

201
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:30,180
Being an idol is tough

202
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:40,000
She's made her appearance, and I hear the website is getting huge traffic, too.
But why is it so busy, one thing after another?

203
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:46,040
I guess it's because it's Image Improvement Month?
That's what Ryo-chan says, but something about it seems fishy.

204
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:54,840
Ugh, I'm so tired of all this Komachi work.
Don't say things like that, come on.

205
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:58,020
Komachi-chan is an idol all over Japan now,
after all.

206
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:01,000
Being an idol isn't easy, is it.

207
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,000
Why don't you give her a little rest?

208
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,580
No, we have to make
hay while the sun shines.

209
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:09,020
No, no, before the money-making
opportunity slips away.

210
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:10,040
Come on, Komachi, let's go!

211
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:16,540
License

212
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:18,920
What do you think you're doing with that?

213
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:22,580
That's the license agreement
for Komachi merchandise.

214
00:12:22,940 --> 00:12:24,740
It's signed in your name, Senpai.

215
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,580
So you were using Komachi-chan after all.

216
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:29,520
So Ryo-chan was just trying
to make money off her.

217
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,160
No, well, it's not like that...

218
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,080
Ow

219
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:35,180
How dare you,
how dare you talk back to me like that!

220
00:12:35,180 --> 00:12:36,720
How dare you...

221
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:40,240
What did you say, you mountain monkey?
You've been acting like a big idol!

222
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:44,280
What about you?
You threw away a whole stack of your own!

223
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:48,440
Anyone with frizzy hair like yours could never become an idol,
you know!

224
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:52,040
You liar, claiming this was
to boost Katsushika's image!

225
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:54,240
You played with my girlhood, didn't you?

226
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,620
C-Komachi-chan...

227
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:58,780
You never know where the watchers' eyes are.

228
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:01,200
Here they come!

229
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:07,160
W-what on earth is going on here?

230
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:10,500
That idol Komachi is embracing a man!

231
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:12,180
Secret romance exposed!

232
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:14,860
Excuse me, where did you and Komachi meet?

233
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:16,320
Where was your first date?

234
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:18,020
Are you two dating seriously,
with marriage in mind?

235
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,800
Noooooo!

236
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:22,920
Why does it always end up like this?

237
00:13:34,860 --> 00:13:38,260
This is the Kameari Park police
box that's the talk of the town.

238
00:13:38,660 --> 00:13:41,820
As you can see, a huge number of
reporters have swarmed the area.

239
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:43,520
Shock!

240
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,500
Ono Komachi's lover revealed

241
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:50,820
He's Police Sergeant Kankichi Ryotsu
of the Kameari Park police box.

242
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:56,900
Mr. Ryotsu says he met Komachi during the
big cleanup at Katsushika Police Station.

243
00:13:56,900 --> 00:14:00,460
Their dates are always at a French
restaurant in Roppongi called P.

244
00:14:00,460 --> 00:14:02,900
Did you really say that, Ryo-san?

245
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,780
Of course I didn't, damn it!

246
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:06,560
Yeah, this gorilla of a man!

247
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:07,460
What?!

248
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:11,800
The other paper also has
comments from Komachi's parents.

249
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:14,560
They say the two even
had a wedding ceremony.

250
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:17,960
That was just Dad jumping to conclusions.

251
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:21,480
But once it's printed like this,
it's hard to clear up the misunderstanding.

252
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,500
No way.

253
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:27,300
These rumors always grow fins and take on a life of their own,
don't they?

254
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:30,600
They'll write about planets
they've never even talked about,

255
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:33,620
writing as if they'd seen them firsthand,
without a second thought.

256
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:34,920
Ryo-sama!

257
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:35,840
Him too!

258
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,060
Hey, Maria.

259
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,320
What on earth is this
article supposed to be?

260
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:41,340
And I'm right here, you know.

261
00:14:41,500 --> 00:14:44,480
No, that article is complete nonsense...

262
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:47,240
Idiot! No cheating from Ryo-sama!

263
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,640
Wait, Maria! Calm down!

264
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:52,300
Oh my, another shocking new revelation!

265
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:55,074
Idol Komachi's fiancé,

266
00:14:55,124 --> 00:14:57,280
Officer Ryotsu has a mistress!

267
00:14:57,940 --> 00:14:59,880
N-no! It's not like that!

268
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:01,540
Ryo-sama and Maria...

269
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:02,060
Excuse me!

270
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:03,920
What's your name?

271
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,080
It's Maria.

272
00:15:05,660 --> 00:15:06,960
Th-then, th-then...

273
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:11,020
Have you been seeing
Officer Ryotsu for a while?

274
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:11,940
Yes!

275
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,460
What's the relationship between you two?

276
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:15,600
We've even slept together.

277
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,360
Hey, Maria!

278
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:19,120
Well, this is a real scoop!

279
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:23,460
No, wait, listen everyone! Maria's a man!

280
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,820
What a shocking confession!

281
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:30,120
Officer Ryotsu's mistress
turns out to be a man!

282
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:33,960
So, a man means...

283
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:43,400
So that's what you're saying?

284
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:44,080
Yes.

285
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,440
But if there's love,
something like that is trivial.

286
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,740
Hey, Ryo-sama.

287
00:15:49,740 --> 00:15:52,700
Saying something like that will
get you completely misunderstood!

288
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:54,780
Shock after shock.

289
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:59,100
Senior Officer Ryotsu has a mistress,
a man he's been living with for many years!

290
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:01,900
Ryo-san, is what Maria said true?

291
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:05,360
Well, it's definitely true, though.

292
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:06,980
What about me?

293
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:09,280
Completely forgetting about Komachi...

294
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:10,800
...being left behind.

295
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,740
In this soft, wimpy era!

296
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:16,240
The new hero loved by women and men alike!

297
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:18,180
His name is Ryotsu Kankichi!

298
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:22,800
Here, here, and here too.

299
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:26,000
Every TV channel is nothing but Ryo-san!

300
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,580
It's not just TV, you know.

301
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:30,180
Women's weekly magazines
are all about Ryo-chan too.

302
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:34,660
Komachi-san isn't
mentioned anywhere anymore.

303
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:36,500
Poor Komachi-chan.

304
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:38,640
Even men's fashion
magazines are covering it.

305
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:41,540
Bowlegs and short legs are
what make a man attractive.

306
00:16:41,540 --> 00:16:43,340
Now is the age of Ryotsu!

307
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:47,680
Well, today we have the much-talked-about,
officially endorsed Ryotsu Kankichi

308
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,520
Ryotsu merchandise lineup.

309
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:52,500
These are called the
Kankichi Connected Eyebrows.

310
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,700
Let me try them on for a moment.

311
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,040
How do they look?

312
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:58,220
They're manly and wonderful.

313
00:16:58,220 --> 00:17:01,880
And if you order now,
you'll also get these Kankichi sandals.

314
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:04,660
Well, those are also essential
for projecting masculinity.

315
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:06,060
Yes, they're indispensable items.

316
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:08,460
So, call us right now!

317
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:11,440
Starting today,
you too can be a Ryotsu Kankichi.

318
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:13,020
Sir, what'll it be?

319
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:14,880
Please give me the Ryotsu cut.

320
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:17,700
Kankichi hunting, right?
It's all the rage right now.

321
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:19,740
Yeah, they're super cool, after all.

322
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:23,500
Best-Dressed Gentleman Award
goes to Mr. Kankichi Ryotsu

323
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:25,860
Tokyo's famous specialty, Ryotsu Senbei

324
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:27,660
Mass-produced key chains

325
00:17:28,150 --> 00:17:29,540
Mass-produced alarm clocks

326
00:17:29,540 --> 00:17:32,060
Hey, how long are you going to sleep?
We've been waiting forever!

327
00:17:32,700 --> 00:17:34,020
Standard item, mass-produced

328
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:37,160
Officially licensed,
mass-produced camera-ri bicycle

329
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:38,880
Kankichi Radio

330
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:42,580
Guaranteed stock,
mass-produced clapperboards

331
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,660
Mass-produced Kankichi photo book

332
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:53,160
Who does that idiot think he is?

333
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:04,770
For goodness' sake.

334
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:08,760
Wherever I turn, it's Ryotsu, Ryotsu.
I can't get a moment's rest.

335
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,360
Daisuke's here?

336
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:16,640
I'm home.

337
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,640
Welcome back! Grandpa!

338
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,963
Daisuke, you've gotten so big.

339
00:18:21,013 --> 00:18:22,920
Well then, let me hold you.

340
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:26,760
Grandpa, I've got something good.

341
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:27,740
What is it?

342
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:32,560
Isn't it cool, Grandpa?

343
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:38,440
The new hero beloved by women and men alike.

344
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,820
Ryotsu Kankichi!

345
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:42,360
In these soft times, Guts!

346
00:18:43,320 --> 00:18:44,980
The times were waiting for me.

347
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:49,000
You've become such a big star, Ryo-chan.

348
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,820
Because they said he looks like a senior.

349
00:18:50,820 --> 00:18:53,580
I hear more and more people
are keeping gorillas as pets.

350
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:56,080
What on earth is everyone thinking?

351
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,540
It's truly the end of the century.

352
00:18:57,540 --> 00:18:58,880
How deplorable.

353
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,420
Chief.

354
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:01,520
The people from the TV station

355
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:04,720
say they want to interview
Ryo-san's supervisor.

356
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,700
What? Me?

357
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:08,600
Then here we go.

358
00:19:09,300 --> 00:19:09,940
Start.

359
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:15,160
Well Ryotsu-kun... ever since he was assigned here,
he's been a huge nuisance.

360
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:15,960
No, no, no, that's...

361
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:21,760
Kankichi Ryotsu is the model
officer of our Katsushika station.

362
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:26,880
This is entirely the result of my daily training,
Tondagomes.

363
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:30,340
Don't forget, Tondagomes, Tondagomes.

364
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:51,460
What's this?
Kankichi Ryotsu everywhere you look!

365
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:54,380
Just until recently it was the Komachi boom,
wasn't it?

366
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:57,120
What was that, anyway?

367
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,960
Wow! It's Kankichi Ryotsu!

368
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,480
Please shake my hand.

369
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:04,040
Please let my baby touch
the celebrity's eyebrows.

370
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,300
Okay, go ahead.

371
00:20:05,300 --> 00:20:07,700
Nyahaha, being popular is tough.

372
00:20:07,700 --> 00:20:10,120
If you want to be as popular
with the ladies as I am,

373
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:12,700
by all means, buy these Ryotsu goods.

374
00:20:12,700 --> 00:20:14,700
Who does she think she is,
getting carried away like that?

375
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:17,440
I wondered who it was...

376
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:20,300
Who was it again?

377
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,680
Yeah, I'm pretty sure it was
until just the other day...

378
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:25,720
There was that policewoman going
on about being an idol or something.

379
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,400
Who was it, again?

380
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:28,660
Phew.

381
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,000
I can't remember.

382
00:20:36,260 --> 00:20:38,820
How about that, Ryo-san? Pretty good

383
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:41,440
It's like looking in a mirror.

384
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:45,440
The perfect version of the Ryotsu
Kankichi original 1/1 scale figure

385
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:49,440
But Ryo-san, this time it really
will be all right, won't it?

386
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:51,780
We failed with this before, after all.

387
00:20:51,780 --> 00:20:53,480
This time there's no mistake.

388
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:56,200
Right now,
anything with my name on it will sell.

389
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:58,240
For starters,
we're making one million units.

390
00:20:58,820 --> 00:21:01,020
I'm putting my entire fortune into this.

391
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:04,860
First, we'll blanket TV and
magazines with commercials.

392
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,920
Ryo-san, I'm counting on you.

393
00:21:15,740 --> 00:21:18,020
The woman waited, and the man cried.

394
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:21,360
Ryotsu Kankichi original
1/1 scale complete figure.

395
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:24,060
Nationwide simultaneous release tomorrow!

396
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:36,940
So the release day is finally today

397
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:38,520
The senpai is putting on a brave front,

398
00:21:38,940 --> 00:21:42,000
but are we really going to be fine
after making a million of them?

399
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:44,940
Look, on TV, Reiko Akimoto is

400
00:21:44,940 --> 00:21:47,580
being interviewed about Ryo-san's figure.

401
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:50,900
Since Reiko is so sensitive to trends,

402
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:54,740
she's bound to buy the Ryotsu figure
everyone's talking about right away, right?

403
00:21:55,300 --> 00:21:56,400
Me?

404
00:21:56,400 --> 00:22:00,260
If Reiko-chan said she wanted one,
that would be total panic.

405
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:00,720
Yeah.

406
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:05,260
I hate Ryo-san, he's kind of old and smelly.

407
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:10,300
Ryo-san is lame, gross,
and I'm not interested.

408
00:22:18,220 --> 00:22:22,120
Everyone, thank you so much for waiting.

409
00:22:27,780 --> 00:22:28,180
This is

410
00:22:37,300 --> 00:22:40,600
Reiko-chan's one remark was what sealed it,
wasn't it.

411
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:42,300
That's just how booms are.

412
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:44,260
It's no good, making things up like that.

413
00:22:44,260 --> 00:22:44,720
This is bad.

414
00:22:47,140 --> 00:22:48,200
What's wrong, Ryo?

415
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,660
There he is, over there!

416
00:22:51,620 --> 00:22:52,860
What's all the commotion?

417
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:56,720
Now I'm the one being chased by the press.

418
00:22:58,620 --> 00:23:02,400
They say this physique and
face soothe your frazzled mood.

419
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,440
What?

420
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:05,700
So now it's a Terai-san boom?

421
00:23:11,660 --> 00:23:14,640
Excuse me, it's time. Please wake up.

422
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:36,900
This is ridiculous!

423
00:23:37,460 --> 00:23:39,800
What about my share?!

424
00:23:43,300 --> 00:23:46,580
And now, an announcement for our viewers:
there's a giveaway!

425
00:23:47,580 --> 00:23:49,380
Right now, the item that's hugely
popular with the trendy young crowd,

426
00:23:49,380 --> 00:23:51,460
the Big Shot keychain, is being raffled off

427
00:23:51,460 --> 00:23:52,340
8 million pieces!

428
00:23:53,080 --> 00:23:55,380
I already told you, that's not how it works!

429
00:23:55,380 --> 00:23:59,000
Listen, don't you dare send in
a postcard by mistake, got it?

430
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,100
Understand?

431
00:24:02,740 --> 00:24:05,300
A documentary about an idol
going mountain climbing?

432
00:24:05,500 --> 00:24:06,440
What's that supposed to be?

433
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:08,640
A part-time job on that shoot?

434
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:10,100
8,000 yen an hour?

435
00:24:10,300 --> 00:24:11,500
Alright, leave it to me!

436
00:24:11,500 --> 00:24:15,440
With my sense of style, I'll show you
footage with real power and realism!

437
00:24:16,020 --> 00:24:18,560
Next time: "The Skilled Video Cameraman"

438
00:24:18,560 --> 00:24:19,540
See you then!

439
00:24:24,180 --> 00:24:25,580
Thank you for watching.

